<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῑμ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>muzzle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ φιμώσεις βοῦν ἀλοῶντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>De.</u>
					25.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>shut up as with a muzzle,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τῷ ξύλῳ τὸν αὐχένα</span>
			<i>to make fast</i> his neck in the pillory, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				592
			</span></i> (troch.); <i>close, seal up,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμα [ἄγγους</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.984
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>muzzle, put to silence,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				22.34
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be put to silence, be silent,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιμώθητι, πεφίμωσο,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				1.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.39
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Peregr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mim.Oxy.</u>
				413.122
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i>by</i> or <i>because of</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.22.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.1.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιμοῦσθαι πρός τι</span>
			<i>to be mute</i> in a matter, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Prooem.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.275
			</span></i>.</div>
